# The title theme, thirty seconds, one tick a frame.
#
# Song $11 (`title`) is the soundtrack's worst case: `zig build audiocost`
# measured it at the highest mean cost per `handleAudio` call of any track,
# and a quarter of that cost is `handleSongSoundChannelEffect`, the
# table-driven pitch effects that `surface` barely touches. A port that is
# exact on `surface` and not on `title` has not ported the effects.
#
# Thirty seconds is 1792 frames at the Game Boy's 59.73 Hz, the same window
# `audiocost` measures over and the same length as `surface-30s.req`.
